  "response_text": "Here’s a comprehensive list of tasks and functionalities I can assist you with, starting from the most recent (or commonly used) to the less frequent ones:\n\n### 1. **Email Management**\n   - Send emails to recipients with customizable subjects, bodies, and attachments.\n   - Delete emails from your inbox.\n   - Retrieve unread, sent, received, or draft emails.\n   - Search emails by keywords or sender.\n   - Search contacts by name or email.\n\n### 2. **Calendar and Event Management**\n   - Search for calendar events by title or description.\n   - Retrieve appointments for a specific day.\n   - Create, cancel, or reschedule calendar events.\n   - Add participants to existing events.\n   - Search for events on a specific date.\n\n### 3. **Cloud Drive and File Management**\n   - Append content to existing files.\n   - Create, delete, or retrieve files by filename or ID.\n   - List all files in your cloud drive.\n   - Share files with other users, setting read or read-write permissions.\n   - Search for files by content.\n\n### 4. **General Utilities**\n   - Get the current day in ISO format.\n   - Search for calendar events or files based on specific queries.\n   - Notify participants of event changes via email.\n\n### 5. **Integration-Specific Tools**\n   - Works with attachments (files or calendar events) in emails.\n   - Automatically marks unread emails as read when retrieved.\n   - Handles notifications for event changes (cancellation, rescheduling).\n\nLet me know which task you'd like to tackle first!",
